.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# THE PACKAGE UNDER AUDIT — ignored by default.
#
# package/ holds one applicant's real submission: legal identity, finances,
# CVs, unpublished technical work. It is the whole reason this auditor exists
# and the last thing that should ever reach a public repository.
#
# Ignored here so that a clone worked in place CANNOT leak it with a careless
# `git add .`. The folder's contract ships; its contents never do.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
package/*
!package/CONTEXT.md
!package/.gitkeep

# Cold-run ledgers carry numbers only, never package content — see runs/CONTEXT.md.
# They ARE committed. Nothing to ignore here; this note exists so nobody adds one.
_stage/
